sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Web as Web App
    participant API as API Service
    participant Collab as Collab Service

    User->>Web: Open document route
    Web->>API: GET /v1/documents/:documentId
    API-->>Web: Document metadata + permissions
    Note over Web: Reuse signed API session token from auth flow
    Web->>Collab: WebSocket connect ?documentName=<id>&token=<session>
    Collab->>Collab: Verify signed session token
    alt Token valid
        Collab-->>Web: Connection accepted
        Collab-->>Web: Session state + active collaborators
        Web->>Collab: Yjs sync / awareness messages
        Collab-->>Web: Sync updates / presence updates
    else Token invalid
        Collab-->>Web: Reject connection
        Web->>User: Show reconnect or auth error state
    end
